{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2022-05-12 16:32:00', 'title': "STATE STREET ANNOUNCES CHAIRMAN & CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND VICE CHAIRMAN & CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER TO PARTICIPATE IN AUTONOMOUS BERNSTEIN'S ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE", 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE: STT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS CHAIRMAN & CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, RON O'HANLEY, AND ITS VICE CHAIRMAN & CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, ERIC ABOAF, WILL PARTICIPATE IN AUTONOMOUS BERNSTEIN'S 38TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE IN NEW YORK ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 1, 2022, AT 3:30 PM ET. AN AUDIO WEBCAST OF THE EVENT WILL BE ACCESSIBLE ON THE HOME PAGE OF STATE STREET'S INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE, WWW.INVESTORS.STATESTREET.COM. A RECORDE"}{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2022-05-12 08:30:00', 'title': 'STATE STREET GLOBAL ADVISORS LAUNCHES SPDR® MARKETAXESS INVESTMENT GRADE 400 CORPORATE BOND ETF', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET GLOBAL ADVISORS, THE ASSET MANAGEMENT BUSINESS OF STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE: STT), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE SPDR MARKETAXESS INVESTMENT GRADE 400 CORPORATE BOND ETF (LQIG). DESIGNED TO BLEND THE ADVANTAGES OF AN ETF WITH THE TRADABILITY BENEFITS OF INVESTING IN US INVESTMENT GRADE CORPORATE BONDS WITH HIGHER LIQUIDITY COMPARED TO THE BROADER U.S. CORPORATE BOND MARKET, LQIG OFFERS INVESTORS CREDIT EXPOSURE WITH THE POTENTIAL FOR TIGHTER BID-AS'}{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2022-05-12 06:31:00', 'title': 'FUTUREGROWTH ASSET MANAGEMENT ADOPTS CHARLES RIVER® FOR MANAGING FIXED INCOME STRATEGIES', 'text': 'LONDON--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #ASSETMANAGEMENT--SOUTH AFRICAN ASSET MANAGER FUTUREGROWTH HAS SELECTED CHARLES RIVER TO MANAGE THEIR FIXED INCOME STRATEGIES'}